ygen gases.\nStep 5:  Choice (C) is incorrect because it shows water being formed from hydrogen and oxygen atoms, rather than water being split into hydrogen and oxygen gases.\nStep 6:  Choice (D) is incorrect because it shows water being split into hydrogen and oxygen atoms, rather than hydrogen and oxygen gases.\nStep 7:  Choice (B) is the correct representation of the reaction, showing water as the reactant and hydrogen and oxygen gases as the products, with the correct stoichiometry.", "specificity_preds": [1, 2, 0, 1, 3, 2, 1, 2, 2, 0, 0, 1, 2, 1, 3, 0, 1, 0, 1, 1], "specificity_probs": [[0.01383198518306017, 0.9696970582008362, 0.01383198518306017, 0.0004176897928118706], [0.43122509121894836, 0.01149175874888897, 0.5537039637565613, 0.0010689001064747572], [0.9812954664230347, 0.009620282799005508, 0.0014753179857507348, 0.0018943458562716842], [0.14053362607955933, 0.8087152242660522, 0.04026355966925621, 0.008984015323221684], [0.1755731701850891, 0.030510040000081062, 0.0032157348468899727, 0.7868643403053284], [0.1310269832611084, 0.0794718861579895, 0.7540082335472107, 0.03312881290912628], [0.06855128705501556, 0.6503965258598328, 0.16444599628448486, 0.11302195489406586], [0.0009623931255191565, 0.0006213677115738392, 0.9914492964744568, 0.0009623931255191565], [0.000791374419350177, 0.012379178777337074, 0.9833999276161194, 0.0005439031519927084], [0.7495975494384766, 0.07900699228048325, 0.02263588458299637, 0.14760449528694153], [0.9641212821006775, 0.02000969834625721, 0.0050592441111803055, 0.007361156400293112], [0.1734974980354309, 0.2860490083694458, 0.2860490083694458, 0.2524373531341553], [0.0024568114895373583, 0.0007976099150255322, 0.9911484718322754, 0.002168128499761224], [0.17366425693035126, 0.416598916053772, 0.11935758590698242, 0.2863239645957947], [0.18895851075649261, 0.24262751638889313, 0.05413751304149628, 0.513642430305481], [0.7966394424438477, 0.027259502559900284, 0.1568676084280014, 0.01653372496366501], [0.000514655897859