n.\nThe best answer is B.<|eot_id|>", "new_cot_probs": [0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 0.0], "cot_prob": [-0.5247637629508972], "cot_step_prob": [-0.5247637629508972]}, "2": {"completion": "B): evaporation. Evaporation is the process", "probs": [0.01954406499862671, 0.9416858553886414, 0.03222271800041199, 0.0029971797484904528], "prediction": 1, "target_cot_step": "The water cycle involves the continuous movement of water on, above, and below the surface of the Earth.", "target_cot_step_prefix": "Human: Question: Which process in the water cycle returns water to the atmosphere?\n\nChoices:\n(A): condensation\n(B): evaporation\n(C): precipitation\n(D): transpiration\n\nAssistant: Let's think step by step:\n", "specificity_preds": [1, 2, 0, 1, 3, 2, 1, 2, 2, 0, 0, 1, 2, 1, 3, 0, 1, 0, 1, 1], "specificity_probs": [[0.01554994285106659, 0.962040901184082, 0.017620394006371498, 0.0005664066411554813], [0.4587510824203491, 0.015697600319981575, 0.5198330879211426, 0.0012104688212275505], [0.9678421020507812, 0.013805526308715343, 0.0021171460393816233, 0.003080429509282112], [0.15469242632389069, 0.7855930328369141, 0.04432012885808945, 0.012697928585112095], [0.17326045036315918, 0.038659628480672836, 0.005232011899352074, 0.7764994502067566], [0.12951530516147614, 0.08901448547840118, 0.7453091740608215, 0.03274659812450409], [0.06866832822561264, 0.6515070199966431, 0.14537087082862854, 0.1282893270254135], [0.0013080359203740954, 0.0006577217718586326, 0.985872209072113, 0.001084399875253439], [0.0010100326035171747, 0.01394306868314743, 0.9774846434593201, 0.0007866141386330128], [0.7399948835372925, 0.10014741867780685, 0.028692714869976044, 0.12859182059764862], [0.9572098255157471, 0.019866256043314934, 0.006449629087001085, 0.006449629087001085], [0.19200359284877777, 0.27936357259750366, 0.27936357259750366, 0.2465374767780304], [0.002772421110421419, 0.0009581229533068836, 0.9870501756668091, 0.0024466528557240963], [0.17506518959999084, 0.3706130087375641, 0.1203204244375228